Description: Akatsuki Linux AI/ML metapackage
 Includes scientific Python libraries, Jupyter, and
 containerization/virtualization tools for data science
 and machine learning workloads. AI frameworks like
 PyTorch and TensorFlow should be installed via pip
 in a virtual environment.
